  {
   "id": "best-served-cold-318952@post-2025-02-13",
   "gameId": "best-served-cold-318952",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes - Demo",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-13T10:57:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Gameplay",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The Tutorial has been adjusted to better explain the functionality of the Bell to end the day in the Bar.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Bell is now highlighted when no customers remain in the bar to help new players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Tutorial has been adjusted to better explain the functionality of the Coat Rack to end the day in the Home Office.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "John Lacy now has a consistent Bad Mood to better reflect his overall personality in the story.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elliot Lynn now has a Bad Mood when entering the bar after his date was cancelled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "UI",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A warning regarding sensitive and potentially disturbing topics has been added to the game start-up sequence.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI has been improved to work consistently on less common resolutions, such as Ultrawide or 16:10.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Controller Support has been improved for navigating the Notebook UI.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Clicking the arrows in the tutorial windows has been made easier.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Writing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A variety of typos and grammatical errors have been fixed. This is an ongoing process that continues as we receive feedback from users.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where replaying the cutscene from the Notebook didn’t work.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where loading save files made during certain stages of the game could cause a softlock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a setting for the Camera that caused Post-Processing to look too harsh on ultrawide resolutions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a setting for the Camera that allowed the view to go out of bounds on Ultrawide monitors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug for Hugo where certain dialog does not appear in the Dialogue Log.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where text in buttons for dialog choices could overflow.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where text in the pop-up for clue unlocks was cut off in the Home Phase.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Known Issues",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re looking into an issue that may occur when mouse and controller input are simultaneously used. Until fixed, we recommend only using one or the other.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Some save files from previous patches might not fully function anymore - apologies for this inconvenience. Hopefully our save system is now more robust.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Message from the Developers",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "On behalf of everyone at the Rogueside team, we’d like to thank you all for engaging with us and sharing your experiences with the game. Production is still ongoing, and we want to ensure we can deliver the best experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve received a lot of feedback through our in-game report system, and are working hard to make sure any issues are addressed by the time we release the full game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re following the discourse on our social media accounts, as well as through media shared on platforms like Youtube and Twitch. It has been a pleasure to see so many people having a good time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more updates regarding Best Served Cold!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in Bukovie, bartenders!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
